rom hash: ac1682f1abcf590311a233289ee325214c2d71ab3a5aa175004002d85075e56
rom name: base_WL-SM3.gb

1. extrair rom pelo gb_recompiled
    1a. buildar o gb_recompiled - a partir da pasta raiz deste projeto
        cmake -G Ninja -S gb-recompiled -B gb-recompiled/build
        ninja -C gb-recompiled/build
        

    1b. buildar o executavel do recompiled - a partir da pasta raiz deste projeto
        gb-recompiled/build/bin/gbrecomp base_WL-SM3.gb -o compiler_src/game_code
        #cmake -G Ninja -S compiler_src/game_code -B compiler_src/game_code/build
        #ninja -C compiler_src/game_code/build
        #./output/game/build/game

2. aplicar patch
    python3 compiler_src/widescreen_patches/apply_widescreen_WL-sm3.py rom.gb compiler_src/game_code/

3. flickering
python3 tools/inject_text.py --map tools/patch_flickering.json --dir compiler_src/game_code --regex --apply
python3 tools/inject_text.py --map tools/widescreen_fov_patch.json --dir compiler_src/game_code --ext .c --apply

4. executar a ROM hack DX 1.2 no aplicativo
    cmake -G Ninja -S . -B build
    cmake --build build
    ./build/wario_land_port /caminho/para/base_WL-SM3.gb

O aplicativo valida a ROM original pelo SHA-256 e aplica em memoria o IPS
descrito em `tools/wl_sm3_dx_v12_patch.json`; a ROM original nao e modificada.